If you want to make your pet grow a little faster there is a way.
Inventory needed:
a bag of tricks uncursed or blessed,
ring of conflict uncursed or blessed,
cursed item,
Place needed:
a room with only one entrance/exit.

(1)  get out in front of your pet and get to the
doorway of your growing room first,
(2) drop cursed item in doorway,
(3) go into growing room,
(4) wear ring of conflict,
(5) apply bag of tricks twice,
(6)  watch the entertainment,
(7) when one monster has died apply bag of tricks again,
(8) while entertainment is going on search corpse for useful items,
(9)  if a real wimpy monster kills off your more powerful monster kill off
the wimp and go collect cursed item from doorway,
(10) make sure food never gets in doorway,
(11) since the door is cleared your pet should come in and pig out,
(12)  If pet isn't big enough walk pet out dropping cursed item
in doorway,
(13)  repeat earlier process if necessary,
while the entertainment is going on you don't want your pet in the
room since it might get killed,
(15)  if you can find another room like yours on the same level and
you have more than one cursed item make sure room is clear walk pet in and
drop cursed item in that doorway and write elbereth inside that door this
should keep your pet safe until it's time for dinner.

